Source: localsend
Section: net
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Ackerman-00 <quietcraft@gmail.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), binutils, xz-utils, zstd
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/localsend/localsend

Package: localsend
Architecture: amd64
# Runtime set mapped from the RPM spec's Requires (t64 names target Debian
# Testing; the ayatana stack is unchanged by the time_t transition).
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, hicolor-icon-theme, libayatana-appindicator3-1, libayatana-ido3-0.4-0, libayatana-indicator3-7, xdg-user-dirs
Description: Open source cross-platform alternative to AirDrop
 LocalSend is a free, open-source app that enables secure communication
 between devices using a REST API and HTTPS encryption.
